    description: "Ruby class Foo < Bar superclass is not stored in meta.base_classes, so the centralized inheritance linker cannot create extends edges for Ruby. Ruby analyzer creates call edges to parent class but not the metadata the inheritance linker needs. Fix: store superclass in meta.base_classes during symbol extraction."  # c2aa
